\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father, Son, and Holy Ghost,
\par One in Three, and Three in One.
\par As by the celestial host,
\par Let Thy will on earth be done;
\par Praise by all to Thee be given,
\par Glorious Lord of earth and heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Vilest of the sinful race,
\par Lo! I answer to Thy call;
\par Meanest vessel of Thy grace,
\par Grace divinely free for all,
\par Lo! I come to do Thy will,
\par All Thy counsel to fulfil.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. If so poor a worm as I
\par May to Thy great glory live,
\par All my actions sanctify,
\par All my words and thoughts receive;
\par Claim me for Thy service, claim
\par All I have and all I am.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Take my soul's and body's powers;
\par Take my memory, mind, and will,
\par All my goods, and all my hours,
\par All I know, and all I feel,
\par All I think, or speak, or do;
\par Take my heart, but make it new.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Now, O God, Thine own I am,
\par Now I give Thee back Thine own;
\par Freedom, friends, and health, and fame
\par Consecrate to Thee alone:
\par Thine I live, thrice happy I;
\par Happier still if Thine I die.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Fatther, Son, and Holy Ghost,
\par One in Three, and Three in One,
\par As by the celestial host,
\par Let Thy will on earth be done;
\par Praise by all to Thee be given,
\par Glorious Lord of earth and heaven.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

